## 2. Decision
A: no, the latest Arm build (1.19.3) does not draw.
B: no, the x64 build crashes (0xC0000005) under emulation without drawing OpenCode's screen, and step 1.4 leaves no
   x64 opencode.exe (the install fails).
=> C: Harness reports OpenCode unavailable on Windows on Arm, before a pane opens.

